hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1294","On the authority of Abd al-Rahman ibn Bishr ibn al-Hakam, on the authority of Malik ibn Sa`ir ibn al-Khams, Hisham informed us, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Aisha, that The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, “ordered the construction of the mosque in the courtyard.”"
